@host = http://localhost:5077

### Provision models, one space, and the seed documents
POST {{host}}/api/setup

### Baseline retrieval
POST {{host}}/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sessionId": "demo-user",
  "message": "What is the refund policy for annual plans?",
  "useReranker": false
}

### Compare baseline and reranked retrieval against identical session history
POST {{host}}/api/compare
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sessionId": "demo-user",
  "message": "What is the refund policy for annual plans?"
}

### Demonstrate memory across API restarts
POST {{host}}/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sessionId": "demo-user",
  "message": "What did I ask you previously?",
  "useReranker": true
}
